<title>THAILAND: Thailand's Padaeng sells shares in Australian firm.</title>
<headline>Thailand's Padaeng sells shares in Australian firm.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's zinc smelter Padaeng Industry Plc has sold all the shares it holds in Australia-based Western Metals, a company statement said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
